---
import Layout from '../../../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import '../../../../styles/equipment.css';
import checks from '../../../../../public/equipment/16-05/verification.json';
import m from '../../../../../public/equipment/16-05/interactions.json';
const a='/equipment/16-05/', exterior='https://tuttnauer.com/sites/default/files/2021-05/tuttnauer_3870flyer.pdf';
const display=x=>Object.entries(x??{}).map(([k,v])=>k+': '+String(v)).join('; ');
---
<Layout pageTitle="Tuttnauer 3870EA empty-tray geometry" subtitle="" description="A locked exterior and a passive empty carrier fit visualization for the Tuttnauer 3870EA." wide={true}>
<article id="tray" class="equipment"><nav class="eq-nav"><a href="/simulations/equipment/16-05/">← Equipment 16-05</a><a href="/simulations/equipment/">Equipment register</a><a href="#tray-checks">Verification</a></nav>
<header><p class="eq-meta">16-05 / Tuttnauer 3870EA / Static carrier-clearance gauge</p><h2>Tuttnauer 3870EA</h2><p>Inspect a fixed, locked exterior and check whether an empty inert carrier fits a nominal section. The 286 × 675 × 25 mm example leaves 36.923 mm radial allowance and 50 mm to a modeled static door plane.</p></header>
<div class="e-grid"><section class="e-card"><h3>01 · Inspect the housing and section</h3><div id="tray-views" class="e-row">{['Bench','Front','Section','Rear'].map(k=><button type="button" data-view={k.toLowerCase()}>{k}</button>)}<button id="tray-xr" type="button" disabled>VR unavailable</button></div>
<canvas id="tray-model" aria-label="Orbitable locked 3870EA exterior and geometrical cutaway with empty tray"></canvas><p id="tray-asset" role="status">Loading metric GLB…</p><p class="e-hint">The latch is display-only and marked locked. The section is a change in geometry visibility, not a door operation. Click the empty carrier in the section to gauge it; drag to orbit and scroll or pinch to zoom.</p></section>
<section class="e-card"><h3>02 · Gauge the empty carrier</h3><div class="e-row"><button id="tray-section" type="button" aria-pressed="false">Show geometry section</button><button id="tray-example" class="e-run" type="button">Check ready example</button></div>
<form id="tray-form" novalidate><div class="e-fields"><label>Empty carrier ID<input name="trayId" value="empty-carrier-01" maxlength="96"/></label>{[['widthMm','Width (mm)',286,500],['depthMm','Depth (mm)',675,900],['heightMm','Height (mm)',25,150]].map(([k,t,x,u])=><label>{t}<input name={k} type="number" min="1" max={u} step="any" value={x}/></label>)}</div>
<div class="e-row"><button id="tray-check" class="e-run" type="submit">Gauge carrier</button><button id="tray-oversized" type="button">Use too-long example</button><button id="tray-reset" type="button">Reset</button></div></form><p id="tray-state" role="status">Exterior representation. Latch displayed locked.</p></section></div>
<section class="e-card"><h3>03 · Read the static margins</h3><p id="tray-result" role="status">No tray geometry evaluated.</p><div class="e-row"><button id="tray-json" disabled>Export geometry JSON</button></div><p>The red ring marks an assumed front exclusion plane, the teal ring the rear datum. An inferred horizontal guide fixes the center 47.5 mm below the circle center. Width and height determine the farthest corner; the radial margin is 192 mm minus that distance. Rear-aligned depth margin is 760 − 15 − 20 mm minus carrier depth. Those reserves are original geometry assumptions, not manufacturer clearances. <a href={a+'example-fit.json'}>Example result</a>.</p></section>
<section><h3>Configuration and source</h3><div class="e-grid"><figure><img src={a+'original-front.svg'} width="760" height="450" alt="Original locked 3870EA exterior rendering"/><figcaption>Original exterior rendering based on the legacy 3870EA silhouette and proportions.</figcaption></figure><figure><img src={a+'original-work.svg'} width="760" height="450" alt="Original cutaway illustration and empty carrier geometry"/><figcaption>Original section witness with empty carrier. Chamber construction is not reproduced.</figcaption></figure></div>
<div class="e-over"><table><thead><tr><th>Dimension</th><th>Nominal value</th><th>Source</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Housing width × depth × height</td><td>665 × 875 × 525 mm</td><td><a href={exterior}>Tuttnauer 3870EA legacy product sheet, p. 1</a>. Legacy cabinet only, no stand model.</td></tr><tr><td>Nominal opening × interior depth</td><td>Ø384 × 760 mm</td><td>Same sheet, model 3870EA row.</td></tr><tr><td>Reference carrier width × depth × height</td><td>286 × 675 × 25 mm</td><td>Same sheet, narrower listed tray outline. Guide elevation and plane allowances are inferred.</td></tr></tbody></table></div>
<p>The model does not simulate clearance during an insertion path, measured tolerance, contents, sterility or any operating state. The catalogue’s processing/cycle acceptance is outside this geometry-only pass. The housing scale, nominal empty-carrier fit, and computed sign of the two margins are the only verification claims.</p></section>
<section id="tray-checks"><h3>Verification and files</h3><div class="e-over"><table><thead><tr><th>Case</th><th>Expected</th><th>Actual</th><th>Status</th></tr></thead><tbody>{checks.map(x=><tr><td>{x.id}</td><td>{display(x.expected)}</td><td>{display(x.actual)}</td><td>{x.pass?'Pass':'Fail'}</td></tr>)}</tbody></table></div>
<p><a href={a+'reference-plan.json'}>Predeclared cases</a> · <a href={a+'verification.json'}>Verification data</a> · <a href={a+'3870ea-tray-gauge.glb'} download>Metric GLB</a> · <a href={a+'geometry-source.mjs'}>Editable geometry</a> + <a href={a+'make-model.mjs'}>generator</a> + <a href={a+'mesh-writer.mjs'}>mesh writer</a> · <a href={a+'interactions.json'}>Interaction targets</a>. {m.triangles.toLocaleString()} triangles and {m.draws} draw primitives; optional WebXR, physical headset untested.</p></section></article></Layout>
<script>import '../../../../lib/equipment/16-05/client.mjs';</script>
<style>
#tray header{max-width:73ch;padding:1.3rem 0}#tray h2{font-size:clamp(2rem,6vw,4rem);margin:.2rem 0}#tray section{margin:1rem 0}.e-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr));gap:1rem}.e-card{border:1px solid var(--border);padding:.8rem;min-width:0}.e-card h3{margin:.3rem 0}.e-row{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:.4rem;margin:.5rem 0}.e-fields{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr));gap:.55rem}.e-fields label{display:grid;gap:.2rem}.e-fields input,#tray button{min-width:0;min-height:2.45rem;border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:3px;background:var(--panel);color:var(--text);font:inherit;padding:.3rem .5rem;box-sizing:border-box}#tray button:disabled{opacity:.52}.e-run{background:#3d596e!important;color:white!important}#tray-model{width:100%;height:clamp(280px,34vw,440px);display:block;background:#ebe8e0;touch-action:none}#tray-chart{width:100%;max-height:16rem}.e-over{overflow:auto}#tray table{border-collapse:collapse;width:100%;font-size:.85rem}#tray td,#tray th{text-align:left;padding:.45rem;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border)}#tray figure{margin:0}#tray img{width:100%;height:auto}@media(max-width:820px){.e-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.e-fields{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr))}}
#tray caption{text-align:left}#tray input,#tray select,#tray button{min-width:0}#tray .e-hint{font-size:.92rem}</style>
